{"sectionId":"coordination/complex","items":[{"id":"coordination--complex-k001","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"배위결합은 Lewis 염기 리간드의 전자쌍 공여와 중심금속의 수용으로 설명한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k002","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"배위수는 중심에 결합한 donor 원자 수이며 리간드 분자 수와 다를 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k003","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"NH₃,H₂O는 단좌, ethylenediamine은 이좌, EDTA는 흔히 육좌 리간드다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k004","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"중심금속 산화수는 착물 전체 전하에서 리간드 전하 합을 빼 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k005","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"착물 명명에서 리간드와 금속의 이름, 산화수 및 착이온 전하를 고려한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k006","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"대표 구조는 배위수 2 선형, 4 정사면체 또는 평면사각형, 6 팔면체이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k007","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitI