ependently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k014","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"NO₂⁻와 SCN⁻은 결합 원자에 따른 이성질 가능성이 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k015","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"킬레이트는 고리형 배위 구조를 만든다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"coordination--complex-k016","sectionId":"coordination/complex","unitId":"coordination","subject":"chemistry","text":"Fe²⁺, d⁶이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}